            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Malayalam for to count and check, then the Malayalam for to sell off."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: കൊടുമുടി",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കൊടുമുടി — koṭumuṭi — \"a peak; a summit\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മഞ്ഞുകാലത്ത് ആ കൊടുമുടിയിൽ മഞ്ഞ് വീഴും. maññukālattŭ ā koṭumuṭiyil maññŭ vīḻuṁ. In winter snow falls on that peak."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also the peak of anything: the top of fame or of a career."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കൊടുമുടി (koṭumuṭi) is a Malayalam compound whose second part is മുടി, the hair or crown of the head (DEDR 4921); the origin of the first part is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
